{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a virtual world crafted by the tech giant <strong>Haber</strong>, where speed and agility are the keys to survival. Using seamless, momentum-based movement, leap from platform to platform, wallrun with style, and navigate a simulation that feels that it's somehow getting more... abstract. Your only ally is <strong>Seraphon</strong>, a friendly AI gives tips about what Haber is hiding behind the simulation\u2019s polished aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, levels change, and get harder\u2014 and the Agents watching from the shadows grow more aggressive. Piece together a scattered story as you start to understand the role you were meant to play\u2026 and the role Haber never expected you to figure out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Alterchase 1.0 (also called Alterchase V2)\u00a0 is the completed version of Alterchase. If you are looking for the previous version, there will be a branch titled &quot;Classic Alterchase.&quot; Switch to that branch to go back.</i></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I figured it out...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777320/300e2b70ab2295f0a3f3f0997218f04ed1ebce99.jpg"},{"name":"Imagine dying!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777320/263cb9340cbc4a38289759a6150d6c5f99ab86e2.jpg"},{"name":"Take that!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777320/096762ea94e6ec551183deb9ae1261a04bc31ddb.jpg"},{"name":"Are you kidding me?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777320/372f15a9e7103bcaa71c14a5d125125b3f0650ce.jpg"},{"name":"Is this some sort of joke?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3777320/4f136213c95d00b33d6f148126ae1657c997b617.jpg"},{"name":"X_X","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/